    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="2.5">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IVAtr">IV Atr</ref> 2.5</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Homines de Rotomago qui veniebant cum vino vel craspisce dabant rectitudinem sex sol. de magna navi et viginti frustrum de ipso craspisce.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Men of Rouen, who came with wine or blubber-fish paid a duty of 6 shillings for a large ship and 5% of the fish.</ab>
